Description: Tooling for Waveshare Raspberry Pi relay hats
 relay-tools provides CLI utilities and an HTTP API for controlling
 Waveshare Raspberry Pi relay hats.
 .
 It supports the Waveshare RPi Relay Board (B) and provides:
  - Direct relay control commands (on, off, toggle, status)
  - A FastAPI-based HTTP API daemon
  - An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for AI agents
  - systemd service units for automatic startup
 .
 All Python dependencies (including the MCP SDK) are bundled in a
 self-contained virtualenv under /opt/venvs/relay-tools; only the
 system Python interpreter of the matching distribution release is
 required at runtime.
